{
  "id": "c1-e36-music-and-identity",
  "level": "C1",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Music and identity",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good morning. First of all, we'd like to know a little about you.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e36-music-and-identity/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4300
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, what part does music play in your daily life?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e36-music-and-identity/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4300
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, has your taste in music changed over the years?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e36-music-and-identity/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4700
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think the music people like says something about them?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e36-music-and-identity/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4900
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, have you ever learnt to play an instrument?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e36-music-and-identity/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3800
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you three pictures. I'd like you to talk about two of them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question briefly about your partner's pictures.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e36-music-and-identity/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e36-a1",
            "c1-e36-a2",
            "c1-e36-a3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your pictures show people enjoying music. Choose two of the pictures and say what music might mean to these people, and why they might have chosen this kind of music.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e36-music-and-identity/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11900
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, what kind of music do you associate with your own culture?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e36-music-and-identity/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5000
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e36-b1",
            "c1-e36-b2",
            "c1-e36-b3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your pictures show music in public settings. Choose two of the pictures and say how music brings people together here, and what differences there could be between the audiences.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e36-music-and-identity/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 12800
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, can music help divided groups understand each other?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e36-music-and-identity/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5000
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some ways in which music influences people, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e36-music-and-identity/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 10100
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "c1-e36-music-and-identity",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might music influence the way people see themselves and others?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e36-music-and-identity/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7600
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "c1-e36-music-and-identity",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which influence is the strongest?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e36-music-and-identity/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about music and identity.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e36-music-and-identity/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5300
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "To what extent does the music we listen to reflect our identity?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e36-music-and-identity/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4900
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, has streaming made people more or less adventurous in what they listen to?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e36-music-and-identity/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6200
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, should young people learn the traditional music of their country at school?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e36-music-and-identity/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Can music be used effectively to bring about social change?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e36-music-and-identity/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4500
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, is it right that musicians earn so little from streaming?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e36-music-and-identity/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q6",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, do you think artificially generated music could replace human musicians?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e36-music-and-identity/p4-q6.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6500
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
